#: ../../chapter07.rst:2
msgid "Deployment Scenarios"
msgstr "Udrulningsscenarier"

#: ../../chapter07.rst:5
msgid "Private On-premise"
msgstr "Privat On-premise"

#: ../../chapter07.rst:7
msgid ""
"You can prepare a Windows Server 2025/2022/2019 and install CentreStack. "
"In this scenario, Active Directory is typically at the same site and "
"primary storage is from file server or NAS storage."
msgstr "Du kan forberede en Windows Server 2025/2022/2019 og installere CentreStack. I dette scenarie er Active Directory typisk på samme sted, og primær opbevaring er fra filserver eller NAS-opbevaring."

#: ../../chapter07.rst:10
msgid ""
"In this case, most of the time you are using CentreStack as a way to "
"replace VPN to provide access to onsite file server from mobile devices "
"and remote devices."
msgstr "I de fleste tilfælde bruger du CentreStack som en måde at erstatte VPN for at give adgang til filserver på stedet fra mobile enheder og fjernenheder."

#: ../../chapter07.rst:15
msgid ""
"Business Access use case - provide access to file server via CentreStack "
"to mobile devices. When employees are in the office, they access the file"
" server their normal way without noticing any difference, and while on "
"the road or from remote location, they can use mobile and remote device "
"to access file server network shares."
msgstr "Business Access-brugssag - giver adgang til filserver via CentreStack til mobile enheder. Når medarbejdere er på kontoret, tilgår de filserveren på deres sædvanlige måde uden at bemærke nogen forskel, og mens de er på farten eller fra en fjern lokation, kan de bruge mobile og fjernenheder til at få adgang til filserverens netværksdelinger."

#: ../../chapter07.rst:25
msgid "Private Off-Premise"
msgstr "Privat Off-Premise"

#: ../../chapter07.rst:27
msgid ""
"Normally, a managed service provider (MSP) manages your IT services, such"
" as hosted exchange servers, hosted file servers etc. You can ask the "
"same managed service provider to install and manage the CentreStack for "
"you in their data center."
msgstr "Normalt administrerer en managed service provider (MSP) dine IT-tjenester, såsom hosted exchange servere, hosted file servere osv. Du kan bede den samme managed service provider om at installere og administrere CentreStack for dig i deres datacenter."

#: ../../chapter07.rst:30
msgid ""
"Usually from this deployment scenario, if the file server is already in "
"the same data center, typically it turned into the \"Private On-premise\""
" deployment."
msgstr "Normalt fra dette udrulningsscenarie, hvis filserveren allerede er i samme datacenter, bliver den typisk omdannet til \"Privat On-premise\" udrulning."

#: ../../chapter07.rst:33
msgid ""
"If on the other hand, the file servers are away from the data center, "
"this gets turned into \"Business Continuity\" use case, where the server "
"agent can be installed on the local file server and connects the local "
"file servers to the remote CentreStack server in the data center."
msgstr "Hvis filserverne derimod er væk fra datacentret, bliver dette omdannet til et \"Business Continuity\"-anvendelsestilfælde, hvor serveragenten kan installeres på den lokale filserver og forbinde de lokale filservere til den fjernbetjente CentreStack-server i datacentret."

#: ../../chapter07.rst:39
msgid "Virtual Private Cloud"
msgstr "Virtuel Privat Sky"

#: ../../chapter07.rst:41
msgid ""
"In this deployment scenario, you would deploy the CentreStack solution in"
" a virtual private cloud environment such as Amazon EC2. CentreStack is "
"also available in the form of AMI image to facilitate creation of EC2 "
"instances. In this deployment scenario, the typical primary storage "
"connection is to the Amazon S3 storage. You can also setup CentreStack "
"solution in an environment like HP Helion (OpenStack) Cloud, with a "
"Windows Server 2025/2022/2019 connecting to OpenStack Swift storage."
msgstr "I dette udrulningsscenarie ville du implementere CentreStack-løsningen i et virtuelt privat cloud-miljø som Amazon EC2. CentreStack er også tilgængelig i form af et AMI-billede for at lette oprettelsen af EC2-instanser. I dette udrulningsscenarie er den typiske primære lagerforbindelse til Amazon S3-lageret. Du kan også opsætte CentreStack-løsningen i et miljø som HP Helion (OpenStack) Cloud, med en Windows Server 2025/2022/2019, der forbinder til OpenStack Swift-lager."

#: ../../chapter07.rst:48
msgid "Multi-Site Deployment"
msgstr "Multi-Site Udrulning"

#: ../../chapter07.rst:49
msgid "Please reference multi-site deployment."
msgstr "Henvis venligst til multi-site udrulning."

